== Design conformance to the spec's FIXED design (criterion 4) ==
(a) orig-desc fallback uses the SAME affinity rule.
    cmd: git show master:internal/services/dataloader/near_duplicates.go > master_nd.go
    Master's inline rule (master_nd.go:220-227) is `na==""||nb=="" -> false`,
    `HasPrefix either way -> true`, else `commonPrefixLen(na,nb) >=
    pendingPostedPrefixMinLen`. The worker's hasPendingPostedAffinity
    (near_duplicates.go:260-270) is that rule verbatim, and
    isPendingPostedPair:242 calls it on Description, :252 on
    OriginalDescription. Only removed lines in the whole file diff are the two
    `na := normalizeOriginalDescription(a.Description)` lines (moved into the
    helper), `return isPendingPostedPair(a, b)`, and three doc-comment lines:
    cmd: git diff master -- internal/services/dataloader/near_duplicates.go | grep '^-'
    out: -// any of three shapes:
         -//     by the bank in between (see isPendingPostedPair).
         -	return isPendingPostedPair(a, b)
         -// amount charges on different cards.
         -	na := normalizeOriginalDescription(a.Description)
         -	nb := normalizeOriginalDescription(b.Description)
